WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.929
Where I come from

00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:05.630
the news is being hijacked.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.250
No matter where you turn,

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.800
there are characters

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.250
where you used to see experts.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.120
Journalism itself has become a scripted reality
show.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.820
But reality is a lot more complex than that.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.430
There are 50 billion shades of gray

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:27.500
it’s not just good vs. evil, us vs. them,
black and white.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.369
And in countries like Russia, China, Turkey

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:32.890
people are told that it’s that simple

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:35.730
the state media want them to believe that.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:36.940
And if you’re a journalist there

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.210
and you’re trying to get beyond that,

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.260
to get to the truth

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:43.950
you are facing scare tactics, intimidation

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.930
and I wonder: is that where we’re headed
as well?

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.260
My responsibility as a journalist is

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.190
to get beyond the smoke and mirrors

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.260
to get to the truth.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:57.040
It’s not just about being fair and balanced
or being neutral

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.400
it’s about being truthful.

